          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.21,
          "end": 9.643,
          "en": "that we can output on this game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.06,
          "end": 13.57,
          "en": "For this, we should add a new piece of state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.57,
